Description: bounded process supervisor for RoboTest Lab
 RoboTest Supervisor owns configured Linux process groups, monitors timestamped
 heartbeat files, performs bounded exponential-backoff recovery, and exposes
 read-only health, readiness, status, and metrics endpoints on loopback.
 .
 The package includes a disabled-by-default systemd unit and a startup wrapper
 for a separately staged ROS 2 workspace under /opt/robotest-lab.
